{"id":2230,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2230"},"modified":"2025-10-03T13:18:06","modified_gmt":"2025-10-03T13:18:06","slug":"triple-wall-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/triple-wall-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Triple Wall Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1 data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"182\">Durable Triple Wall Cardboard Boxes<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"662\">Triple wall cardboard boxes are designed for maximum strength and durability. They are built to protect heavy, fragile, and oversized items during storage and shipping. Whether you need them for industrial use, relocation, or long-term warehousing, these boxes provide unmatched support. We at <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"533\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/a> manufacture custom triple wall cardboard boxes at wholesale prices, giving you cost-effective options with premium protection.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"898\">We also provide <strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"730\">coating options like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/strong>, along with free design and shipping. Custom sizes and styles are available with quick turnaround times, ensuring your packaging requirements are met with precision.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"903\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"946\">Strong protection with multiple layers<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1195\">Triple wall cardboard boxes feature three layers of corrugated board, making them significantly stronger than single or double wall cartons. These boxes are ideal for transporting sensitive equipment, machinery parts, electronics, or bulk goods.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1331\">\n<li data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1231\">\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1231\">Extra strength for heavy loads<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1262\">\n<p data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1262\">Reliable stacking capacity<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1297\">\n<p data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1297\">Shock and vibration resistance<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1331\">\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1331\">Suitable for export packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1336\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"330\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"328\">Exploring packaging durability levels<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1706\">When comparing different board types, <strong data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1534\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/double-wall-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1532\">Double Wall Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> remain popular for medium-weight items. However, triple wall boxes offer the additional security required for military shipments, industrial tools, and overseas freight.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1802\">This makes them an excellent choice for businesses where safety and stability are essential.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1807\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"477\"><strong data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"475\">Understanding board options for shipping safety<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"2282\">Triple wall boxes belong to a wider family of corrugated packaging solutions. Businesses can also explore other options within the <strong data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2135\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-material-strength\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2133\">Cardboard Boxes by Material Strength<\/a><\/strong> category to find solutions for lighter or moderate loads. This ensures every product type gets packaging aligned with its shipping requirements.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"4312\">\n<thead data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2546\">\n<tr data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2546\">\n<th data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2361\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2435\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2473\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strength Level Options<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2498\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Coating Choices<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2546\" data-col-size=\"md\">Common Applications<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"4312\">\n<tr data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2987\">\n<td data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Board Structure<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2876\" data-col-size=\"md\">Triple corrugated flutes bonded with linerboard<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Single, Double, Triple Wall<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2938\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, Gloss, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2987\" data-col-size=\"md\">Heavy duty storage and transit<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3207\">\n<td data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3022\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dimensions<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3096\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fully customizable, standard and oversized sizes available<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3134\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Small, Medium, Large<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3158\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lamination available<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3207\" data-col-size=\"md\">Export packaging, industrial goods, machinery<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3427\">\n<td data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3242\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Load Capacity<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3316\">Supports very heavy and bulk shipments<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3354\">50kg \u2013 500kg+<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3378\">Anti-scratch coating<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3427\">Warehousing, freight, relocation<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3648\">\n<td data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3462\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Printing Support<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3537\" data-col-size=\"md\">Full-color CMYK and PMS printing with high-resolution branding<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3575\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One side or two sides<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3599\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Offset, Digital<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3648\" data-col-size=\"md\">Branded cartons, identification printing<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3870\">\n<td data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3683\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Closure and Handling<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3758\" data-col-size=\"md\">Tuck-in flaps, adhesive sealing, straps, or staples<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Manual or machine sealing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Edge reinforcement<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3870\" data-col-size=\"md\">Long-haul shipping, military packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"4091\">\n<td data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3905\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eco-Friendly Materials<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3980\" data-col-size=\"md\">Recyclable corrugated and kraft board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"4018\" data-col-size=\"sm\">FSC-certified<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Water-based inks<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4091\" data-col-size=\"md\">Sustainable packaging solutions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4312\">\n<td data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4126\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bulk Availability<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4126\" data-end=\"4201\" data-col-size=\"md\">Wholesale supply for large orders with cost-saving pricing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4239\" data-col-size=\"sm\">From 100 units to 50,000+<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4263\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Free design support<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4263\" data-end=\"4312\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate orders, export runs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr data-start=\"4314\" data-end=\"4317\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4319\" data-end=\"4367\">Practical uses of triple wall cardboard boxes<\/h2>\n<ol data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4546\">\n<li data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4413\">\n<p data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4413\">Moving large industrial products safely<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4414\" data-end=\"4454\">\n<p data-start=\"4417\" data-end=\"4454\">Packaging bulk shipments for export<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4455\" data-end=\"4497\">\n<p data-start=\"4458\" data-end=\"4497\">Securing delicate or high-value goods<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4546\">\n<p data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4546\">Providing storage for heavy warehouse items<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<hr data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4551\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4590\">Additional benefits for businesses<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"4592\" data-end=\"4809\">\n<li data-start=\"4592\" data-end=\"4633\">\n<p data-start=\"4594\" data-end=\"4633\">Quick turnaround production schedules<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4634\" data-end=\"4681\">\n<p data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4681\">Free shipping available in selected regions<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4682\" data-end=\"4744\">\n<p data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"4744\">Custom inserts and dividers available for added protection<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4809\">\n<p data-start=\"4747\" data-end=\"4809\">Logo printing and branding available for easy identification<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4814\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4816\" data-end=\"4847\">Final thoughts on durability<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4849\" data-end=\"5165\">Triple wall cardboard boxes provide reliable performance for the most demanding shipping requirements. They are trusted by industries ranging from automotive to military supply chains. For businesses that need bulk or wholesale solutions, these boxes offer cost-effective packaging that does not compromise safety.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5167\" data-end=\"5317\">Explore more heavy-duty solutions within <strong data-start=\"5208\" data-end=\"5248\">Cardboard Boxes by Material Strength<\/strong> to ensure you find the right balance of durability and efficiency.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Need extra-strong cardboard boxes? Shop Cardboard Boxes offers wholesale prices on triple wall cardboard boxes. These heavy-duty boxes are ideal for shipping fragile or valuable items. We provide free design services, fast turnaround times, and free shipping to ensure you get the best value. Contact us today to explore our printing options and start customizing your boxes.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2311,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[180],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2230","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-material-strength","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/pro